  },
  "art_gap": "Reads as a fenced patch of grass with camp props. Needs a soddy or cabin, a kitchen garden and a well. Derived location: the homestead is written in Elena Ochoa's and Marguerite Solis's pages, its position near Providence is my inference and is recorded in LOCATIONS.md."
